  • single slash (`?/`)  
  • escaped backslash (`?\\`)  
  • non-ASCII characters (e.g. `?あ`)  
  • `\u{…}` Unicode codepoint notation (`?\u{1AF9}`)  
  • control/meta sequences (`?\C-a`, `?\M-a`, `?\M-\C-a`, `?\C-\M-a`, etc.)  

